xgameruntime: Only talk to Xodus when XODUS_INTEROP is enabled.

private.h defines XODUS_INTEROP as 0 and the other call sites use #if, but
InitializeApiImplEx2 used #ifdef, so it always connected to the Xodus
socket. Without a running Xodus service, XGameRuntimeInitialize failed and
the game quit right after the "Could not load Xodus's service socket" box.

--- a/dlls/xgameruntime/main.c
+++ b/dlls/xgameruntime/main.c
@@ -173,7 +173,7 @@
     //
     HRESULT hr;
 
-#ifdef XODUS_INTEROP
+#if XODUS_INTEROP
     if ( !unixlib )
     {
         if ( FAILED( hr = LoadUnixLib() ) ) return hr;
